# A copy of Sunken Citadel that did not enter the battlefield as one has no chosen color: "as it enters, choose a color"
# is a replacement effect on entering (CR 614.12a, 707.2), and the choice is not a copiable value (CR 707.2, 607.2d).
# Shifting Woodland becomes a copy of the Citadel card in Bot1's graveyard (delirium from Wheel of Fortune's discards:
# land, creature, instant, sorcery). Its "one mana of the chosen color" names no color and adds nothing (CR 106.5), and
# no color, green included, is on offer.

